### What it extracts from every invoice PDF:

| Group | Fields |
|---|---|
| **Vendor Invoice** (header) | Invoice Number, Invoice Date, Due Date, PO Number, Payment Terms, Currency, Subtotal, Tax Rate, Tax Amount, Total Due |
| **Vendor Details** | Vendor Name, Vendor Address, Vendor Email, Vendor Phone Number |
| **Bill-To Details** | Bill-To Name, Bill-To Address |
| **Line Items** *(repeating — one row per item)* | Description, Quantity, Unit Price, Amount |

That's **20 fields** covering everything you'd need to key into SAP, including all the individual line items automatically.

