**1. Where do the invoice PDFs arrive?**
- 📧 A specific email inbox (e.g. invoices@yourcompany.com) — I can watch it automatically for new attachments
- 📁 A shared/network folder — I can poll it on a schedule
- Something else (SharePoint, shared drive, etc.)?

**2. How do you want data entered into SAP?**
- **SAP UI automation** — the robot opens SAP GUI and types into the screens directly (most common; works with any SAP setup)
- **SAP BAPI/RFC** — direct integration via function module calls (faster, no GUI needed, but requires SAP technical setup)

**3. What's the SAP transaction you use for invoice entry?**
- Is it **FB60** (vendor invoice - direct posting)?
- **MIRO** (invoice verification against a PO)?
- Or something else your company uses?

Once I know these three things, I can build the complete automation — from PDF arriving, through IXP extraction, all the way to SAP entry — with nothing for you to touch manually.

